sect1.sect2:
Introduction to LibreOffice
LibreOffice is a full-featured office suite. It is largely compatible with Microsoft Office and is descended from OpenOffice.org.
&lfs124_checked;
Package Information
Core Download:
Core Download MD5 sum: &libreoffice-core-md5sum;
Core Download size: &libreoffice-core-size;
Estimated disk space required: &libreoffice-buildsize;
Estimated build time: &libreoffice-time;
Additional Downloads
Around 80 smallish tarballs and zip files will be downloaded during the build. The download time will vary with the local internet speed and server load. The download time is about 3 minutes on a fiber connection and probably not much more than 10 minutes on an ADSL connection. If you have not installed one or more of the following dependencies, they will also be downloaded during the build.
Dictionaries:
Dictionaries MD5 sum: &libreoffice-dict-md5sum;
Dictionaries size: &libreoffice-dict-size;
Help Files:
Help Files MD5 sum: &libreoffice-help-md5sum;
Help Files size: &libreoffice-help-size;
Translations:
Translations MD5 sum: &libreoffice-translations-md5sum;
Translations size: &libreoffice-translations-size;
